          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅብዕ ፡ ልጅነት ፡ አይታጡም ፡ ስብከተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሉቃስ ፡ ነው፡ ይህን ፡ ያስተምራል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፯ ፤ ⟪ወሶበ ፡ ፈትሐ ፡ ራብዐ ፡ ማኅተመ ፡ ይቤለኒ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራብዕ ፡ እምነ ፡ እንስሳሁ ፡ ነዓ ፡ ትርአይ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
